    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to think about \"shifting\" anything when the world itself feels so alien. everything is so new and frantic, and i'm just so tired. i look at the seasons changing and i just feel like i've already had my autumn. i'm just standing there in the cold, waiting for the frost to finally settle so everything can just be quiet. do you think there's any dignity in just... letting go when you know your chapter is done?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
